diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index ff92be649ff3f610b38798b3310751534d032814..76ab7a5ac6c0d23fbbc18fcf426cfc1697d11649 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -3,3 +3,19 @@
 A small TypeScript library, with no runtime dependency, of building blocks for our services that store,
 exchange and update JSON: configuration files, API payloads and stored records. It is imported by the
 other projects of the team, so its behaviour must follow the published standards it implements.
+
+## API
+
+### `resolvePointer(document, pointer)`
+
+Resolves a [JSON Pointer](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6901) string against a JSON document and
+returns the value it refers to.
+
+```ts
+import { resolvePointer } from "json-toolkit";
+
+resolvePointer({ a: { b: [1, 2, 3] } }, "/a/b/1"); // 2
+```
+
+Throws if `pointer` is not a syntactically valid JSON Pointer, or if it does not resolve to a value
+within `document`.
